  (3) Where a Mayor/Do Governor accepts an application for dispute mediation pursuant to paragraph (2), he or she shall notify the Mediation Committee of the results of review prescribed in paragraph (2) along with a copy of the application for dispute mediation within 10 days from the date he or she accepts the application for dispute mediation, and may recommend the parties to the dispute to make an agreement, and where they fail to make an agreement within 20 days, he or she shall refer to the Mediation Committee therefor without delay. <Amended on Jan. 15, 2019>
